    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108459" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποικ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dwell under,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ βορέᾳ</span> (Sylburg for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπείκειν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				945a9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				16.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποικοῦντες,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γείτονες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.113
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>lie hidden,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὀφθαλμοῖς ὑ. δάκρυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.111
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Glauc.
			</span></i>).</div>
